      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-T · Test runner\nRuns the seed emails in **Demos/Launchbench/Test Kit** through WF-0, exactly as if they had arrived by email but without sending any mail.\n\n- Set **Which seeds** to a list like `07, 11, 18`, or leave `only` empty for all 33.\n- **triage_only** on (default): WF-0 classifies and logs to `triage_log` but runs no handler. Use it for the regression. Off: the full pipeline runs (replies to +lb-testrun, staff emails, approval cards).\n- Seeds go in **one every 30 seconds**, like real traffic: firing them all at once would exceed Google Sheets' 60 reads a minute.\n- Each seed gets its persona tag (`[as routewise]`) and keeps its scripted date as `now`. Vendor-invoice seeds get their PDF from `Test Kit/attachments`.\n- Check results with `tools/score_triage.py` (triage only) or `tools/check_e2e.py` (full run); see docs/test-protocol.md.",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 260
      }
    },
